                                "sense_id": "fa397e25-cbae-3af3-8c6c-34e82cd28251",
                                "text": "Ik neem biefstuk met patat, dat is ook echt Vlaams.",
                                "translation": "I will have steak with fries, that is also very Flemish.",
                                "english": "I will have steak with fries, that is also very Flemish."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2b0ef295-dcc8-42dd-a362-5e5f27da3706",
                                "sense_id": "fa397e25-cbae-3af3-8c6c-34e82cd28251",
                                "text": "Bak de biefstuk in de pan vlug bruin. Gebruik een vork om de biefstuk in de pan te leggen.",
                                "translation": "Fry the steak brown quickly in the pan. Use a fork to lay the steak in the pan.",
                                "english": "Fry the steak brown quickly in the pan. Use a fork to lay the steak in the pan."
